./ralph/codex-output/iteration-000068-20260519-031810.log:13628:ralph/codex-output/iteration-000007-20260518-162150.log:4643:gres migrations and never require a live Dokploy server unless explicitly marked external.\",\"Secrets, tokens, API keys, cookies, and rendered environment variable values are redacted in logs, errors, audit metadata, and test output.\"],\"type\":\"backoffice-billing-api\",\"priority\":2,\"passes\":false,\"notes\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"BE-0610\",\"title\":\"Implement backoffice overage policy APIs\",\"description\":\"Allow admins to configure allow, warn, block, and admin-review behavior per entitlement key.\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[\"Overage policies can be set globally, by plan, or by organization override.\",\"Policy changes are versioned and effective_at aware.\",\"Runtime quota and billing logic consume the same published policy.\",\"Tests cover precedence, runtime reload, historical reproducibility, and denied unsafe changes.\",\"All public responses use stable JSON envelopes with schema_version yalla.output.v1 or yalla.error.v1.\",\"Unit tests cover success, validation failure, authorization failure, and not-found behavior.\",\"Integration tests run against isolated Postgres migrations and never require a live Dokploy server unless explicitly marked external.\",\"Secrets, tokens, API keys, cookies, and rendered environment variable values are redacted in logs, errors, audit metadata, and test output.\"],\"type\":\"backoffice-pricing-api\",\"priority\":2,\"passes\":false,\"notes\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"BE-0611\",\"title\":\"Implement backoffice feature flag APIs\",\"description\":\"Allow admins to configure features by plan, organization, project, environment, or service.\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[\"Feature flags have stable keys, boolean/string/number/json variants, targeting rules, and rollout percentages.\",\"Feature flag evaluations are audited for admin-sensitive flags and cached safely.\",\"Flags can enable features such as previews, backups, custom domains, SSO, custom roles, and dedicated Dokploy org mapping.\",\"Tests cover targeting precedence, rollout determinism, cache invalidation, and safe defaults.\",\"All public responses use stable JSON envelopes with schema_version yalla.output.v1 or yalla.error.v1.\",\"Unit tests cover success, validation failure, authorization failure, and not-found behavior.\",\"Integration tests run against isolated Postgres migrations and never require a live Dokploy server unless explicitly marked external.\",\"Secrets, tokens, API keys, cookies, and rendered environment variable values are redacted in logs, errors, audit metadata, and test output.\"],\"type\":\"backoffice-config\",\"priority\":2,\"passes\":false,\"notes\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"BE-0612\",\"title\":\"Implement backoffice runtime config cache\",\"description\":\"Provide safe caching and invalidation for published admin configuration.\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[\"API, worker, and aggregator processes load effective config with version identifiers.\",\"Publishing a config version invalidates local caches via polling or notification.\",\"If config reload fails, services continue using last known good config and emit alerts.\",\"Tests cover reload success, reload failure, stale config warning, and concurrent readers.\",\"All public responses use stable JSON envelopes with schema_version yalla.output.v1 or yalla.error.v1.\",\"Unit tests cover success, validation failure, authorization failure, and not-found behavior.\",\"Integration tests run against isolated Postgres migrations and never require a live Dokploy server unless explicitly marked external.\",\"Secrets, tokens, API keys, cookies, and rendered environment variable values are redacted in logs, errors, audit metadata, and test output.\"],\"type\":\"backoffice-config\",\"priority\":1,\"passes\":false,\"notes\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"BE-0613\",\"title\":\"Implement backoffice permissions and roles\",\"description\":\"Restrict who can manage pricing, metering, billing, and operational configuration.\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[\"Admin actions are split into pricing.manage, metering.manage, billing.manage, feature_flags.manage, support.manage, and config.publish.\",\"Publishing production-impacting config can require a stronger role than drafting.\",\"Break-glass sessions can be required for selected dangerous changes.\",\"Policy matrix tests cover admin roles, support roles, owners, regular users, and service accounts.\",\"All public responses use stable JSON envelopes with schema_version yalla.output.v1 or yalla.error.v1.\",\"Unit tests cover success, validation failure, authorization failure, and not-found behavior.\",\"Integration tests run against isolated Postgres migrations and never require a live Dokploy server unless explicitly marked external.\",\"Secrets, tokens, API keys, cookies, and rendered environment variable values are redacted in logs, errors, audit metadata, and test output.\"],\"type\":\"backoffice-security\",\"priority\":1,\"passes\":false,\"notes\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"BE-0614\",\"title\":\"Implement backoffice configuration export and import\",\"description\":\"Allow safe promotion of config between environments.\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[\"Exports include non-secret config versions and secret reference names, not secret values.\",\"Imports run dry-run validation and produce a diff before applying.\",\"Imports can target staging before production and preserve version history.\",\"Tests cover export, import, missing secret reference, unsafe downgrade, and rollback.\",\"All public responses use stable JSON envelopes with schema_version yalla.output.v1 or yalla.error.v1.\",\"Unit tests cover success, validation failure, authorization failure, and not-found behavior.\",\"Integration tests run against isolated Postgres migrations and never require a live Dokploy server unless explicitly marked external.\",\"Secrets, tokens, API keys, cookies, and rendered environment variable values are redacted in logs, errors, audit metadata, and test output.\"],\"type\":\"backoffice-config\",\"priority\":3,\"passes\":false,\"notes\":\"\"}]"
